 "notes": [
  "Variant order in triples: plain (quantized) / humanize (feature OFF) / humanize + fret-hand-cost (ON), seed 7.",
  "pnd Rhytm, TtN Rhytm and pnd Steel have 2, 12 and 0 shift beats: the check is not applicable (< min_group), consistent with step 0 -- the model barely touches rhythm guitar.",
  "Spring Melody Solo seed 7 onset std 9.77 ms exceeds the 5-9 ms corridor; the 60-seed mean is 8.93. It is the slowest song (75 BPM): humanize alone scales std by (90/75)^0.5 to 7.67 ms mean, and 86 of 211 beats carry a delay. Not tuned down: lowering the curve to fit one slow song would weaken the effect on the others (TtN Solo mean 6.90, pnd Solo 8.57).",
  "jitter_ms of the QUANTIZED export is already 10.57 (pnd Solo) / 11.68 (Spring Melody Solo): odd 32nds sit 40 ticks off the 16th+triplet grid. onset_std_ms is the meaningful guitar timing figure (LESSONS.md p.3)."
 ],
